32:  * <p>This is different from how iterations work in batch processing. Once a feedback point is
33:  * defined you can connect one or several {@code Transformations} as a feedback edges. Operations
34:  * downstream from the feedback point will receive elements from the input of this feedback point
35:  * and from the feedback edges.
36:  *
