38:  * differing partitioning strategies. This requires, however, that the parallelism of the feedback
39:  * {@code Transformations} must match the parallelism of the input {@code Transformation}.
40:  *
41:  * <p>The type of the input {@code Transformation} and the feedback {@code Transformation} must
42:  * match.
