756:      * 0 to the number of TaskManagers, started so far, minus one. This method starts a TaskManager
757:      * with the next index which is the number of TaskManagers, started so far. The index always
758:      * increases with each new started TaskManager. The indices of terminated TaskManagers are not
759:      * reused after {@link #terminateTaskManager(int)}.
